  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nAll of the \"#1 Dad\" mugs in the world change to show the actual ranking of Dads suddenly. No one knows how this started but it sure has caused excitement!\n\nThe first Dad to be ranked \"#1 Dad\" is a man named John.  John is a normal man from a small town. He lives simply and has two children. He is a loving and devoted father. He has a simple job and is a devoted husband.\n\nJohn is suddenly the most famous man in the world. Journalists want to interview him. Other dads want to meet him. He does not know what to do.",
